  "strategy": [
    "Bind node caches to exact captured Markdown bytes/path inventory, effective configuration and local/bundled template inputs.",
    "Bind root skill caches and all-enabled-workspace capability skill inputs to content plus directory-presence metadata; capture each skill's parse/hash/headings from one read.",
    "Archive sidecars already bind expected payload hashes. Capture live integrity/admission from the same bounded parse-time reads, including tolerant omissions; restore/corrupt transitions invalidate freshness.",
    "Retain mtime checks as early-stale hints, not sufficient fresh proof. Preserve malformed cache syntax/shape diagnostics, no-cache/no-reindex behavior and containment refusal.",
    "Explicit archive compression now selects current authored sidecars without relying on stale cache metadata. The deferred-integrity selection is unbound and never persisted; owner/schema/identity/full-set path preflight still applies before writing.",
    "Imported nodes are already rebuilt from integrity-verified bundles; mtime-based subgraph health is not represented as blanket JSON/security freshness clearance. SQLite's prior content binding remains separate."
  ],
